  "statement_nl": "If t=(t_1,...,t_r) is a sign string with each t_q in {+1,-1}, define x^(0)=x and for q=1,...,r define x^(q)=U(x^(q-1)) when t_q=+1 and x^(q)=D(x^(q-1)) when t_q=-1. Then T_t(x)=x^(r).",
